Construction Technique RVCS - Ventilation Mount
Frigorist and Air Conditioning Installer
Full time Interinale
Candidate
Apply for this job
Frigorist and Air Conditioning Installer
* indicates mandatory fields
Do you want the freedom of temporary work and the security of a permanent?
For 30 years, we have witnessed hundreds of companies in the technical sectors of construction, construction and industry throughout Switzerland, offering them the best talents.
We won't lie to you, but we're demanding. So, if you are a motivated and enthusiastic person, join the clan for the position of Frigorist Installer and Air Conditioning
Mission:
- Installation, maintenance and repair of refrigeration and air conditioning systems;
- commissioning and testing of plants;
- Research and diagnosis of failures;
- ordinary and extraordinary maintenance interventions;
- Reading technical schemes and plant documentation;
- Management of operations at customers and yards;
- Compliance with Swiss regulations on safety and installation.
Profile :
- Professional experience as a fridge, air or refrigeration installer;
- Good knowledge of refrigeration and air conditioning systems;
- Ability to work independently and identify fault causes;
- Accuracy, seriousness and sense of responsibility;
- Availability to work at customers and yards;
- Driving licence category B;
- Good knowledge of Italian language.
Your contact person:
Your contact for this position is David. With over 15 years of recruitment experience, you will be able to accompany, advise and answer all your questions about the location. This job isn't exactly what he's looking for, but do you like our values? Do not hesitate to send us your spontaneous application!
Place of work
Lance
Type of work
Full time - Interinale

